  mid tertile   n_Black=387 (17 ev)  4.39% [2.8,6.9]  vs 7.43% [6.4,8.6]   diff -3.04pp [-5.03,-0.32]  RR 0.59 [0.36,0.96]   hisp 12.9%
  high tertile  n_Black=237 (27 ev) 11.39% [7.9,16.1] vs 19.26% [17.9,20.7] diff -7.87pp [-11.61,-2.99] RR 0.59 [0.41,0.85]  hisp 22.3%
